Subject: The young collection frees its garbage itself, in array passes, over a 4 MB window

What this does
  - quickjs.c gc_young: members are only plain objects and Arrays without weak references. Membership (gc_young), "reached from outside" (gc_live) and the survivor flag (gc_old) are bits of the object (new bits in the byte of gc_old, cleared at the creation sites); the header mark and the tmp_obj_list are no longer used by it. The passes run over the vector of members with prefetch ahead: take the member-to-member edges out of the counts; find the members still counted; put back the edges of the live ones while extending the live set; then free the garbage directly (release what it holds outside S, shape, property block, element block, cell). The garbage's edges into S were never counted back, so nothing is decremented twice and the old restore pass over all garbage is gone.
  - The edge walk is one function for the three modes and reads the child's own flag byte instead of the child's header and type.
  - quickjs.c: the growth step floor is 4 MB (was 16 MB) and so is the initial threshold, so the set a young collection sweeps stays cache resident.
  - QJS_GC_STATS prints per-phase cycles of the young collection (list walk, edges out, roots, reach, release, free cells).

Why we need it
  The young pass cost about 240 cycles per examined object and the freeing 130 per garbage object (deltablue AOT). The trial deletion walked every object's children three times (decrement, restore, search) through the generic mark functions, then freed through the generic free, and the 16 MB sets did not fit in cache.

Soundness
  Same argument as 0511: only edges between members are removed from the counts, so members with outside references and everything they reach are kept. A property that is not plain data (accessor, closure cell, autoinit) is not an edge in any pass and is released with free_property when its owner is freed. Garbage is exactly the members not reached, and no reference from a live member or from outside points at it.

Failure modes
  Cycles through functions, Maps, bound functions or other classes are left to the full collection (they were members of the earlier young pass through the generic mark). A 4 MB step collects more often; the pin and reconcile part is a few thousand cycles.

